---
name: Billing data model and engine
description: Schema and logic for quotations, slab rates, zone detection and billing
type: feature
---
Tables:
- zones (NCR/Regional/Metro/Special/ROI; ROI code='ROI' is default fallback)
- cities (name unique lower, zone_id) — drives automatic zone detection from receiver city
- quotations (company_id, mode, unique(company_id,mode))
- quotation_rates (quotation_id, zone_id, min_weight_g, max_weight_g nullable, rate, rate_unit, available)

rate_unit values: 'flat' (fixed for slab), 'per_kg' (rate*kg), 'add_per_500g' (base flat slab rate + ceil((g-min)/500)*rate).
Engine in src/lib/billing.ts: detectZone(city,cities,zones) and calcSlabCharge(rates, weightKg) -> {available, amount, label}.
Billing page (src/routes/billing.tsx): pick company + date range, match scanned dockets to report documentNo, auto-detect zone, compute amount per matched shipment, zone/mode breakdowns, Excel + PDF export.
Old rate_cards table/route removed from UI (table still exists, unused).
Pending/not yet built: dedicated Reports pages (daily/weekly/monthly/zone/revenue), global search, user roles + login, keyboard shortcuts.
